}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:14Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-06-05T16:15:51Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:24Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107165","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107165","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107165.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107165.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Thorough the class reference there's the concept of \"3D unit\" as the unit of space in 3D, compared to \"pixel\" in 2D. This term is derived from Godot `3.x`, where 3D units were actually not well defined. Nowadays we seem to have standardized \"meters\" in 3D in the editor, across the documentation, and in speech.\r\nThis PR is intended to replace this term accordingly, and make slight tweaks along the way.\r\n\r\nThere's actually a few more cases not covered in this PR, in doubt. Namely:\r\n> Returns the camera's frustum planes in world space units as an array of [Plane]s\r\n\r\n> The size of the light in Godot units.\r\n\r\n> The grid size in units. Higher values prevent the grid from appearing \"cut off\" at certain angles, but make the grid more demanding to render.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107165/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107165/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}